Runtime Options:
  --no-prompt       Never prompt interactively (same as setting
                    FRODO_NO_PROMPT).

Commands:
  delete            Delete OAuth2 trusted JWT issuers.
  describe          Describe an OAuth2 trusted JWT issuer.
  export            Export OAuth2 trusted JWT issuers.
  import            Import OAuth2 trusted JWT issuers.
  list              List OAuth2 trusted JWT issuers.

Utilities:
  help              display help for command


Run without a sub-command to enter interactive mode."
